content": "  Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to bother", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cause someone to feel worried, or concerned", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't use your blog to complain about things or people that bother you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in an article about writing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "observation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "verbal or written thought on something you have seen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A blog is a \u201cweb log\u201d that provides information or observations about a wide range of subjects.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to fit your needs", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to be what someone is looking for in a product or service", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Choose a provider who fits your needs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to document", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to write down", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Maybe you would rather document your visits to your favorite restaurants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "service", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an organization, company, or system that provides something to the public", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You might prefer to shop around rather than choose any service.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flair", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a personal sense of style", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Write with flair!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "golf", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an outdoor game in which players try to hit a small ball with as few strokes as possible into a hole", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Would you rather a game of golf or a run in the park?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing a Blog", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "If you decide to write a blog, there are steps you should follow.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "1. Decide on a topic: What are you going to write about? Choose a topic that interests you.<br><br>2. Find a blog service and sign up. Select a service that meets your requirements.<br><br>3. Design your blog. What colors, photos and designs are you going to choose?<br><br>4. Write the first post: Be sure to proofread your work carefully.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Would rather for what is preferable", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the expression <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span> \u2026 + verb to express a preference. You can also use the contraction <span class=\"italic\">'d rather</span> ...<br>You use <span class=\"italic\">Would you rather</span> \u2026 ? to ask about someone's preferences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Would rather \u2026 </span> introduces a comparison between two options. You use this expression when the context clearly allows the subject to make a choice between one option or the other.<br>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Would you rather visit Spain or Antarctica?</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">would rather + than</span>  to express a comparison between two things. <br>Example: <span class=\"italic\"> I would rather explore the world than work in an office.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When the subjects are different, you use <span class=\"italic\"> would rather + Past Simple</span> .  <br>Example: <span class=\"italic\"> I'd rather you didn't go out tonight.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe you would rather document your visits to your favorite restaurants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Maybe you would rather write about new ideas and events.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research 3 different blog sites on free-time activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare the sites. How are they similar? How are they different?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 sentences. Start one sentence with, I would rather not follow this blogger because\u2026.. and the other sentence with I would rather follow this blogger than the other one because\u2026", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I go online and research blog sites.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare different blog sites.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write sentences that say what I would rather do.", "type": "text"}]}]}